* ''The herm floor reframe'' (operator: //"Herms are the floor capabilities of all Lararia (a lifted herm floor + Pronaos = Node Lararium)."//). A Node Lararium holds a lifted herm floor and the Pronaos. The island capability record composes along the cap stack, floor courses first (`NodeHermResult.islandCaps` carries the floor record), the lift on top (`caps.receipt` names a LIFT capability, since wiki islands exist only on a lifted floor); a herm never stands as a party beside a vessel. Q1 (one answerer per `receipt:request`) landed in PR #157, and the follow lane carried the rest (PR #160, #/ashes `cap-stack`).

